        Flop! <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>’s $CarterBottoms.Type fall to his ankles, exposing his $CarterUndies.Name! This is the final step, as with one final strike <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> loses his balance and falls back onto the ground! You then lower your sword and press the tip firmly against the pouch of his underwear, right against the boy’s tight balls. <br>
        <br>
        <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Eep!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> yelps as he feels the foamy against his weakest point, face red as his underwear is fully exposed. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“I- I give up! I give up!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> cries out, backing away, but you keep moving forward to continue pressing your blade against his defenseless sack. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“St- stop!”</span> You keep <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> pinned against the ground for a moment before you break out laughing and declare yourself the victor! <br>
        <br>
        <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“That’s cheating!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> says, standing up and fixing his bottoms with a pout,</span> <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Using my clothes against me isn’t fair!”</span> You tell <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> there are no rules in combat, especially if he chooses to wear such loose clothing. If he doesn’t want you to use it to your advantage, <span style="color:Pink">maybe next time he should fight you naked.</span> <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“N- no way!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> blushes at this, covering his crotch with his hands, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Plus that wouldn’t be any better! All my stuff would be flopping around! You can’t fight like that!”</span> <br>
        <br>
        <span style="color:Pink">You question if <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> has the size on any of his body parts to flop around like that, which leads to round two as he picks his sword back up to hit you. The epic battle lasts for a while until you are both tired out.</span> <br>

